    "Persistence: the 331-step probe begins from a valid committed limited state and releases it through the ordinary profile. Continuous execution and reloads at boundaries 121 and 200 have identical per-step scene/result hashes.",
    "Version isolation: authority v1 and actual-propulsion v5 goldens remain byte-for-byte unchanged; governed results are stored only in the new independent golden."
